.TH focusforge-cli-diagnostics 1  "diagnostics 0.1.0-rc.1" 
.SH NAME
focusforge\-cli\-diagnostics \- Package this installation\*(Aqs logs, crash reports, system summary, graphics adapter record, effective configuration and version into one ZIP, listing every file before writing it. The home directory and the user name are redacted out of every text entry, image data is never included, and nothing is sent anywhere
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfocusforge\-cli diagnostics\fR [\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-\-include\-minidumps\fR] [\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-v \fR]... [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Package this installation\*(Aqs logs, crash reports, system summary, graphics adapter record, effective configuration and version into one ZIP, listing every file before writing it. The home directory and the user name are redacted out of every text entry, image data is never included, and nothing is sent anywhere
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Where to write the ZIP. Omit for a dated name in the current directory
.TP
\fB\-\-include\-minidumps\fR
Include the minidump binaries. They cannot be redacted
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Overwrite the output path when it already exists
.TP
\fB\-v\fR
Increase log detail (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Log errors only
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH VERSION
v0.1.0\-rc.1
